# Session handoff notes. Working files for whoever picks the work up next —
# they go stale the moment the work moves, and a stale one is worse than none
# because it reads with the same authority as the docs. Keep them local.
HANDOFF.md

# Scratch design drafts — same reasoning as HANDOFF.md above. Promote content
# into a real infrastructure/ manifest or docs/ note when it's actually built.
AUTH-MODEL-DRAFT.md

